WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:03.844
Metro City Bank was surrounded by police officers.

2
00:00:03.845 --> 00:00:07.099
A robber in a mask stuck his head out of the bank.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.408
Detective Smith spoke into a bullhorn.

4
00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:12.040
"Come out with your hands up!"

5
00:00:12.041 --> 00:00:14.690
"No chance!" the robber yelled.

6
00:00:14.691 --> 00:00:16.679
"And don't try to come in here.

7
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.918
We put bombs all over the building!"

8
00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:23.251
Detective Smith reached for his radio.

9
00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:25.716
"Send Rocket Girl—fast!

10
00:00:25.717 --> 00:00:31.496
Before the robbers blow up the bank!"

11
00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:32.974
Roxy was at home in bed.

12
00:00:32.975 --> 00:00:35.842
She was sneezing.

13
00:00:35.843 --> 00:00:38.820
Her throat felt sore.

14
00:00:38.821 --> 00:00:42.129
"Wake up, Roxy!" her mom said.

15
00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.744
"It's time for school."

16
00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:50.982
"Mom, I think I'm sick," Roxy said, shivering.

17
00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:52.755
Roxy's mom frowned.

18
00:00:52.756 --> 00:00:57.403
"Let me check your temperature."

19
00:00:57.404 --> 00:01:02.088
She came back with a thermometer.

20
00:01:02.089 --> 00:01:05.620
"You are sick, sweetheart," she said.

21
00:01:05.621 --> 00:01:07.356
"No school today.

22
00:01:07.357 --> 00:01:11.209
I'll make you some soup."

23
00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:15.540
A minute later Roxy's watch beeped.

24
00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:19.314
"Hello," Roxy said in a scratchy voice.

25
00:01:19.315 --> 00:01:21.802
"Rocket Girl!" Mayor Bloom said.

26
00:01:21.803 --> 00:01:24.094
"Robbers have taken over Metro City Bank.

27
00:01:24.095 --> 00:01:25.203
I need you to—"

28
00:01:25.204 --> 00:01:29.037
"Ah-choo!" Roxy sneezed.

29
00:01:29.038 --> 00:01:32.607
"Are you all right?" Mayor Bloom asked.

30
00:01:32.608 --> 00:01:35.613
"I'm fine, Mayor," Roxy said.

31
00:01:35.614 --> 00:01:37.505
"It's just a cold.

32
00:01:37.506 --> 00:01:40.183
And the city needs me!"

33
00:01:40.184 --> 00:01:42.252
Roxy started to climb out of bed.

34
00:01:42.253 --> 00:01:44.755
But she couldn't stop shivering.

35
00:01:44.756 --> 00:01:47.933
"No, I can't allow it," Mayor Bloom said.

36
00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:51.283
"Get some rest. I'll find another way."

37
00:01:51.284 --> 00:01:53.781
He ended the call.

38
00:01:53.782 --> 00:01:56.578
Then he pressed a button to summon his assistant.

39
00:01:56.579 --> 00:02:02.189
"Call Dr. Odd, please," he said. "And hurry!"

40
00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:05.347
Minutes later Mayor Bloom arrived at Dr. Odd's lab.

41
00:02:05.348 --> 00:02:12.061
A tiny robot named Bippo led him inside.

42
00:02:12.062 --> 00:02:15.979
"I'm so glad you called, Mayor," Dr. Odd said.

43
00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:20.492
"I came back to Metro City to make up for my past crimes."

44
00:02:20.493 --> 00:02:24.577
"Are you sure this robot of yours can help?" Mayor Bloom asked.

45
00:02:24.578 --> 00:02:27.503
"We have a dangerous situation at the bank."

46
00:02:27.504 --> 00:02:29.752
"Yes," Dr. Odd said.

47
00:02:29.753 --> 00:02:34.078
"Crime Fighter Bot can do what no police officer can."

48
00:02:34.079 --> 00:02:37.357
He led Mayor Bloom over to a tall robot.

49
00:02:37.358 --> 00:02:40.804
Its chest was painted like a police badge.

50
00:02:40.805 --> 00:02:43.883
"Shiny, him!" Bippo said.

51
00:02:43.884 --> 00:02:47.878
Dr. Odd pressed a button, and the robot came to life.

52
00:02:47.879 --> 00:02:50.037
Its arm turned into a cannon.

53
00:02:50.038 --> 00:02:52.452
The cannon shot out a net.

54
00:02:52.453 --> 00:02:55.189
The net caught a dummy robot.

55
00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:59.643
"Its artificial intelligence helps it fight crime," Dr. Odd said.

56
00:02:59.644 --> 00:03:03.689
"It can do the work of a whole police force."

57
00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.949
"Wow," Mayor Bloom said.

58
00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.025
"Let's send it to the bank to stop the robbers."

59
00:03:09.026 --> 00:03:11.953
"Don't worry, Mayor," Dr. Odd said.

60
00:03:11.954 --> 00:03:17.898
"Crime Fighter Bot is on its way!"

